            "review_title": "Review at Numero",
            "review_text": "Kevin M\n7 contributions\n0\n10/10!\nDec 2024 • Family\nThis must be the best food I've ever eaten in Vietnam. From professionalism to quality, this restaurant is spotless. I ordered dumpings as a forrett and they were incredibly tasty. After this I ordered water buffalo and it was the highlight of the evening. Everything from darkness to taste. This was a 10/10 price to quality you can hardly find anywhere else. The only thing I have to say is that they don't ask how you want it fried but this I didn't find as one problem. The steak came fried on the outside but quite raw on the inside. This is highly recommended. The mango beer is also a 10/10. lots of taste, zero bad aftertaste.\nRead more\nTranslated from Norwegian\nShow original\nWritten December 2, 2024",
